{"speciesId":439,"names":{"fr":"Mime Jr.","es":"Mime Jr.","en":"Mime Jr.","ja":"マネネ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It habitually mimics foes. Once mimicked, the foe cannot take its eyes off this Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It likes places where people gather. It mimics foes to confuse them, then makes its getaway."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It mimics the expressions and motions of those it sees to understand the feelings of others."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"In an attempt to confuse its enemy, it mimics the enemy’s movements. Then it wastes no time in making itself scarce!"},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"In an attempt to confuse its enemy, it mimics the enemy’s movements. Then it wastes no time in making itself scarce!"},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il imite les mouvements et les expressions des autres pour comprendre leurs sentiments."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It mimics the expressions and motions of those it sees to understand the feelings of others."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il imite les mouvements et les expressions des autres pour comprendre leurs sentiments."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It mimics the expressions and motions of those it sees to understand the feelings of others."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It mimics the expressions and motions of those it sees to understand the feelings of others."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It mimics the expressions and motions of those it sees to understand the feelings of others."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il déstabilise ses ennemis en imitant leurs mouvements et profite de leur stupeur pour décamper."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Desconcierta a sus rivales imitando sus movimientos a la perfección y aprovecha para darse a la fuga."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"In an attempt to confuse its enemy, it mimics the enemy’s movements. Then it wastes no time in making itself scarce!"},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"相手の 動きを そっくりに 真似を して 戸惑わせている あいだに さっさと 逃げるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il imite ses ennemis. Une fois imités, ils ne peuvent plus quitter ce Pokémon des yeux."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Suele imitar a sus enemigos. Cuando lo hace, su rival no puede apartar los ojos de él."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It habitually mimics foes. Once mimicked, the foe cannot take its eyes off this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"相手の 動きを モノマネする 習性。真似を された 相手は 目が 離せなくなる という。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Il déstabilise ses ennemis en imitant leurs mouvements et profite de leur stupeur pour décamper."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Desconcierta a sus rivales imitando sus movimientos a la perfección y aprovecha para darse a la fuga."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"In an attempt to confuse its enemy, it mimics the enemy’s movements. Then it wastes no time in making itself scarce!"},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"相手の 動きを そっくりに 真似を して 戸惑わせている あいだに さっさと 逃げるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il imite ses ennemis. Une fois imités, ils ne peuvent plus quitter ce Pokémon des yeux."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Suele imitar a sus enemigos. Cuando lo hace, su rival no puede apartar los ojos de él."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"It habitually mimics foes. Once mimicked, the foe cannot take its eyes off this Pokémon."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"相手の 動きを モノマネする 習性。真似を された 相手は 目が 離せなくなる という。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il fait de son mieux pour imiter les gestes et les expressions de ses adversaires, mais il a encore des progrès à faire."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Imita los movimientos y las expresiones de otros tan bien como puede, aunque aún le queda mucho por mejorar."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It does its absolute best to mimic the movements and expressions of its opponents, but it’s still not very good at it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"相手の 動きや 表情を 一生懸命に 真似る。 まだまだ うまいとは いえない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Quand un adversaire reste bouche bée face à ses talents de mime, il est tellement content qu’il en oublie de continuer sa performance."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Es un gran imitador. Cuando logra sorprender a su adversario, la alegría le embarga de tal forma que se olvida de continuar su actuación."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"When this gifted mimic surprises an opponent, Mime Jr. feels so happy that it ends up forgetting it was imitating something."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"モノマネが 得意。 相手が 驚くと 嬉しくなって ついつい 真似しているのを 忘れてしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il mime tout ce qu’il voit, et s’entraîne beaucoup pour reproduire les pas de danse élégants des M. Glaquette."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Imita todo lo que ve, especialmente los gráciles pasos de baile de Mr. Rime, que practica con gran tesón."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It mimics everyone it sees, but it puts extra effort into copying the graceful dance steps of Mr. Rime as practice."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"見るもの すべての 真似を する。 バリコオルの 華麗な ステップを ひたすら 真似して 練習する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il considère les meilleurs danseurs parmi les M. Glaquette comme ses maîtres et s’évertue à mimer leurs mouvements."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su admiración por Mr. Rime, un consumado danzarín, lo lleva a seguirlo para aprender de él e imitar con esmero sus pasos de baile."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It looks for a Mr. Rime that’s a good dancer and carefully copies the Mr. Rime’s steps like an apprentice."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"ダンスの うまい バリコオルに 弟子の ように 付き従い ステップを 懸命に 真似する。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Known to turn up in bustling marketplaces now and again. It mimics people much as a child would, then watches how they react, eyes sparkling."}],"varieties":[{"id":439,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[8,"level-up",15],[9,"level-up",15],[10,"level-up",15],[11,"level-up",15],[14,"level-up",11],[15,"level-up",11],[16,"level-up",11],[17,"level-up",11],[18,"level-up",11]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"name":"psybeam","learns":[[8,"level-up",25],[9,"level-up",25],[10,"level-up",25],[11,"level-up",25],[14,"level-up",25],[15,"level-up",25],[16,"level-up",25],[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25],[20,"level-up",28],[23,"level-up",28]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-wave","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[23,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[8,"machine",0],[9,"machine",0],[10,"machine",0],[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"confusio